{"id":"ceremonia","lemma":"ceremonia","pos":"noun","rank":1966,"glosses":["ceremony"],"ipa":"/θeɾeˈmonja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ceremonias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f2/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ceremonia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tienes que ponerte una chaqueta de ceremonia.","en":"You need to wear a tuxedo.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/296237","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to put, to place","l":"poner"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"jacket"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Hicieron una película de toda la ceremonia.","en":"They filmed the entire ceremony.","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"film"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Él asistió a muchas ceremonias.","en":"He attended many ceremonies.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to attend","l":"asistir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},null]},{"text":"La ceremonia comenzó con su discurso.","en":"The ceremony began with his speech.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to begin, to commence","l":"comenzar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"discourse"}]},{"text":"La ceremonia fue imponente.","en":"The ceremony was impressive.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/512885","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"imposing"}]}]}